          "fact": "日期：2026-06-07；标题：NVIDIA and Doosan Group Collaborate to Advance Physical AI and AI Factory Infrastructure；原文内容：NVIDIA and Doosan Group are expanding their collaboration to advance new opportunities across physical AI, robotics and AI factory infrastructure, spanning Doosan Robotics, Doosan Bobcat, Doosan Enerbility and Doosan Corporation Electro-Materials BG. The collaboration will bring together NVIDIA’s full-stack accelerated computing platforms with Doosan Group’s capabilities in industrial automation, power generation an…；来源：https://blogs.nvidia.com/blog/nvidia-and-doosan-group-physical-ai/",
